{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Railblazer",
    "steam_appid": 2996070,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive, mysterious storm has obliterated civilization. In the city of survivors, you are the only veteran engineer capable of navigating the old tracks. Gather clues to uncover the storm's secrets, manage your train and resources, and survive in a world plagued by raiders and harsh environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beware, what lies hidden in the darkness may not always be to your liking.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/30520446af8759e068dd6a8c403e0709.poster.avif?t=1736853167\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/30520446af8759e068dd6a8c403e0709.webm?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/30520446af8759e068dd6a8c403e0709.mp4?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Train</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your unstable train running. Strategically place vehicles in limited space and ensure you have enough resources. Prepare for fuel shortages, frequent breakdowns, and chronic power outages. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Ruined World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a procedurally generated world where you\u2019ll encounter various events in extreme conditions. Investigate different structures across the world to earn rewards, trade with merchants, or resort to raiding. But always be quick\u2014the storm is closing in on you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/c5d1c82e8d1fcafb63c2da0276950d5c.poster.avif?t=1736853167\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/c5d1c82e8d1fcafb63c2da0276950d5c.webm?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/c5d1c82e8d1fcafb63c2da0276950d5c.mp4?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up for chases with raiders. Strategically place defensive structures and maintain control during combat situations. You\u2019ll also face massive enemies that occasionally block your path! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Through Game Over</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use research points from previous expeditions to unlock new items and engines. Experiment with new combinations to build ad train uniquely yours.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/cd3c6f29414403f7cee59da74b6caebc.poster.avif?t=1736853167\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/cd3c6f29414403f7cee59da74b6caebc.webm?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/cd3c6f29414403f7cee59da74b6caebc.mp4?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>Uncover the Secret of the Storm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie within the storms that destroyed human civilization? Uncover the conspiracy behind the storm's occurrence and find clues to confront the great disaster!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A massive, mysterious storm has obliterated civilization. In the city of survivors, you are the only veteran engineer capable of navigating the old tracks. Gather clues to uncover the storm's secrets, manage your train and resources, and survive in a world plagued by raiders and harsh environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beware, what lies hidden in the darkness may not always be to your liking.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/30520446af8759e068dd6a8c403e0709.poster.avif?t=1736853167\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/30520446af8759e068dd6a8c403e0709.webm?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/30520446af8759e068dd6a8c403e0709.mp4?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Train</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your unstable train running. Strategically place vehicles in limited space and ensure you have enough resources. Prepare for fuel shortages, frequent breakdowns, and chronic power outages. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Ruined World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a procedurally generated world where you\u2019ll encounter various events in extreme conditions. Investigate different structures across the world to earn rewards, trade with merchants, or resort to raiding. But always be quick\u2014the storm is closing in on you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/c5d1c82e8d1fcafb63c2da0276950d5c.poster.avif?t=1736853167\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/c5d1c82e8d1fcafb63c2da0276950d5c.webm?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/c5d1c82e8d1fcafb63c2da0276950d5c.mp4?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for Battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up for chases with raiders. Strategically place defensive structures and maintain control during combat situations. You\u2019ll also face massive enemies that occasionally block your path! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grow Through Game Over</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use research points from previous expeditions to unlock new items and engines. Experiment with new combinations to build ad train uniquely yours.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/cd3c6f29414403f7cee59da74b6caebc.poster.avif?t=1736853167\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/cd3c6f29414403f7cee59da74b6caebc.webm?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996070/extras/cd3c6f29414403f7cee59da74b6caebc.mp4?t=1736853167\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br>Uncover the Secret of the Storm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What secrets lie within the storms that destroyed human civilization? Uncover the conspiracy behind the storm's occurrence and find clues to confront the great disaster!</p>",
    "short_description": "As a veteran train operator, you must manage the train. What decisions will you make to confront the enemies? Command the train in real-time as it desperately crosses through the chaos of the storm. Manage resources and the train to survive the treacherous tracks and make it to the end.",
